		(property "Note" "ESP32-S3 SuperMini, hand-soldered on header pins. Pins 1-9 (top row from the USB end): 5V GND 3V3 IO13 IO12 IO11 IO10 IO9 IO8; 10-18: TX RX IO1-IO7. IO13/12 CRSF RX/TX, IO11/10 SDA/SCL, IO9 VBAT, IO8 servo, IO7/IO4 motor forward/reverse, IO6 VTX on, IO5 IR LED, IO1/2 VTX UART TX/RX, IO3 gyro INT, TX (IO43) power hold, RX (IO44) button" (at 58.8 58.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
